oolday_04_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_33","text":"You two are adorable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_34","text":"Adoreable?! How can oy call me doarbale?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_35","text":"So was all that stuff about the brick not true either?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_36","text":"Ye-s! It was all made aup from teh satrt!","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_37","text":"Nicely done. You got me good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_38","text":"I haven't haed that much fun in a hwile.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_39","text":"Actually, I prefer your usual way of texting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"centi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_40","text":"I do too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_41","text":"Real ly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_fullfoolday_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liter","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_fullfoolday_04_42","text":"Okay, if you sya so.","jump":null}],"chat":true}